WEBVTT

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:23.710
<i>Long night under the
midnight sun, I'd gone numb</i>

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:28.670
<i>Disparaging mutters are
meaningless, aren't they?</i>

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:33.590
<i>The light sputtering, dying away in my heart</i>

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:38.510
<i>If I could just grasp it</i>

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:42.890
<i>Come on, rise to tomorrow!</i>

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:50.940
<i>When the awakening comes, let loose
a passionate aria, an unending song</i>

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:56.030
<i>A breathtaking judgment that
echoes in the chambers of the heart</i>

00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>You can never unsee it</i>

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.370
<i>Two libidos with a chance to meet</i>

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:10.550
<i>If you seek an era without
overhunting, look no further</i>

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:20.180
<i>Dancing together stirs our blood,
we rend the veil of darkness</i>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:27.480
<i>Together in front of the door,
we're flooded with adrenaline,</i>

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.980
<i>Bewitched by the devil</i>

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:36.070
"Waltz of Transience"

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.380
The school festival's coming up.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.760
All these crazy things

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.350
have been going on for a while now.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.980
Both my heart and my head are all mixed up.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.900
But I'm still going to school.
I want to know where my mom is,

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:19.110
but more than anything, I'd hate
to give in to the craziness of it all.

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.920
I haven't seen Rem again,

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.880
not since that day.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.640
Ye evil ones, ye who lurk in darkness,

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.220
ye sinister ones...

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:47.310
Be thou all repelled by the
sacred power of the Light.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:56.230
Be careful. The festival
will have plenty of outsiders

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.190
coming and going at will.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:02.240
It's highly likely there will be
devils and vampires among them.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.240
Uh-huh.

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.460
I'm... glad those scratches are gone.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.630
It looked worse than it was.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.710
I'm fine. Don't worry about it.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.670
Morning, Ritsuka!

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:20.680
Morning!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:30.560
Here's the deal: Either Azuna or I
will be with you at all times today.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.350
No going off on your own.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.770
Yeah, yeah...

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.190
I know.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:40.030
We can't let anyone find out about me

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.360
until after my 17th birthday is safely past.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.530
Yep.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.580
We'll get you through this.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.080
It's so beautiful!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.300
Totally different from the
culture festivals in junior high!

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.260
Yeah!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:01.470
Well, it's your first one!

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.930
Yeah, our school festivals
are really spectacular.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:07.850
And tonight's dance will be even grander!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:08.850
Wow!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.560
Hey, you here?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.150
Or not?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:21.740
Cool it with all the creeping around,

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.660
Mr. Fallen Angel.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:27.330
Who cares what happens to that stupid mutt?

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:31.660
But something's missing.
I need to hear that high-pitched yap.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.670
Loewen won't be showing up here again.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.840
He betrayed us.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.510
Betrayed?

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.880
He drew close to us in the guise
of a poor little puppy,

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:48.220
but was still wagging his tail
for his previous master.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.060
The fallen king Maksis?

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:55.270
Didn't your old man defeat
Maksis and seal him away?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.570
Oh, of course: the forbidden grimoire.

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:03.900
Loewen was trying to revive Maksis
with the power of the grimoire.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:04.610
Yes.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.530
Shocking.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:09.160
Good thing he didn't get there first.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:13.080
No problem. I've already found the grimoire.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:13.870
What?!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.120
Did she spill the beans?

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:20.590
No. The grimoire was
never in the Tachibana family.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.670
Professor Tachibana made
arrangements right before his death

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.130
to hide the grimoire.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.140
Where?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.560
Vienna.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.680
Vienna?

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.180
In an old church, well outside the city.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:38.400
My men are already on their way to retrieve it.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.780
Checkmate.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:49.780
May the darkest of blessings be upon this world,

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.200
soon to belong to the Arlond family.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.960
So this world's gonna wind up
in the hands of Rem's old man?

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:02.550
If we swear loyalty to the Arlond family,

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.760
we might just end up with some of the dregs.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.800
You're not thinking this through.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:15.390
We could still snatch the grimoire
before Rem's father gets it.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:18.140
Get a load of this fallen angel.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:28.070
We're not planning that at all, are we?

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.570
No, sirree!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.240
I thought as much.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.170
The grimoire being nurtured
in that body of hers...

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.840
If I remove it, she dies.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.680
Thank you!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.530
Lindo...

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:06.480
What's he doing?

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.110
Ew, creepy!

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:11.990
Yeah, that's... I'll make him stop.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.570
Please.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.410
You have a visitor.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:28.630
I see my lovely butterfly
is as beautiful as ever.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.840
Can I help you?

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:35.510
Be my partner for tonight's dance.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.350
Give over your body and soul,

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.610
and I'll take you to a dizzying world of love.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.070
No way!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:54.570
Are you angry? Because we
kept asking about the grimoire?

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:58.660
We're sorry. Here you really
didn't know anything about it.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:05.670
Yeah, I'm sorry I just snatched
you away like that. I didn't know.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.470
Turns out the forbidden grimoire was in Vienna.

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:12.130
What? Vienna?

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.680
That's what Rem said.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.640
He did?

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.520
Be my partner tonight.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:24.190
Dances aren't really my thing,
but if you wanna dance,

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.230
then I'll dance.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:27.270
No!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.570
Move. You're in my way.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.870
Me? Why don't <i>you</i> get lost?

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:40.910
Boop!

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:48.540
Ooh, even that perturbed face
of yours gets me all a-shiver!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:54.930
Say, be my partner. Let's fall together

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:58.100
as we dance a rondo of immorality and perversion

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.100
straight into the labyrinth's depths...

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.100
Huh?

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:07.270
Your usual fragrance isn't
coming through much today.

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.900
Yeah, I thought so, too.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:13.900
And I really loved that enchanting scent, too.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:14.900
Hey!

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.200
Back off, you three!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.910
Where did <i>that</i> come from?!

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:24.410
You're quite the headache, you know.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.460
Get out of here, you nuisance.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.170
<i>You're</i> the nuisance! This is my good friend.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.130
I won't let you lay your hands on her!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.170
Hey, now, wait!

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.050
Get out of there, you!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:39.390
By the sacred Name, obey me,
o ye who lurk in darkness.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.760
Begone from here--

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.640
Oh! It's the student council!

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.690
There they are! Hey, over here!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.520
--M-My butterflies!
--Squee! Sir Urie!

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:52.280
--Aw, yeah, Bossman Mage!

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:53.690
--Hey! Wait! Ow!
--Aw, yeah, Bossman Mage!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.610
Master Shiki!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.990
Geez!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.740
Persistent buggers, aren't they?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:08.460
But what's that all about,
Rem saying the grimoire was in Vienna?

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.710
He totally lied!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.500
What? Rem?

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:18.300
Sure, to keep those jokers
from interfering with his search.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:21.680
Devils think nothing of lying.
It's like breathing to them!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.220
Uh-huh...

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:44.410
Please take a glass as you enter the ballroom!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.830
Grape for men, orange for women!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:49.830
Whoever gets the crowns is the king and queen!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:54.420
Crowns? What's this "king and queen" stuff?

00:10:54.420 --> 00:11:01.090
Oh, didn't you know? One glass
each has a little crown inside.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.220
Nothing!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.850
Missed again this year!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.770
It happens!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:11.690
Whoever gets them is the king
and queen--the stars of the party.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.230
They have a dance in the middle of everyone.

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.650
Even if they're strangers?

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.700
Yep. It's an old tradition.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.360
Huh!

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.910
The odds are way against you, though.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.420
Thank goodness!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.130
Who's the guy going to be?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.010
Squee! It's the Great Rem!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:46.890
The Great Rem! Isn't he beautiful?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:52.520
Take a glass, Rem, sir!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.770
Thank you.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.550
This year's king is the Great Rem!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.680
Ugh! I don't want him
dancing with some other girl!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.140
No!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.230
Ritsuka! You have to swi--

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:41.240
Happy queen! Happy king! Congratulations!

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.780
But... how...

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.540
Me and Rem...?

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.210
Sheer coincidence.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.090
We just happened to have
the crowns in our glasses.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:01.590
That's all.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.800
I guess so.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.510
This sucks.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:12.220
Did that lousy Rem cheat?

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:16.730
No--it's just coincidence.
You didn't pick up on any magic, did you?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.440
--Dammit.
--Even worse.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:20.570
Ritsuka...

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:25.950
It's okay. They wouldn't
try anything in a crowd like this.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:39.380
Happy queen! Happy king!
Happy queen! Happy king!

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.680
I-I can't dance.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.940
Just follow my lead.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.270
Okay...

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.000
Um...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.040
Thank you.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.920
I don't recall needing your gratitude.

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:24.380
You helped my brother, remember?

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.630
I was only protecting myself.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.510
You're always like that.

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:34.220
You like to say it's all for your own interests,

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:38.440
but you've saved me so many times over.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.360
So hot...

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.990
Our hands are practically burning up.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.490
There's this murmuring inside me...

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:57.160
...like trees swaying in the woods.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:11.090
♪ I am in your eyes ♪

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:19.520
♪ And I am in yours ♪

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:23.770
♪ Our touching hands, so hot ♪

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:29.900
♪ A moment becomes eternity ♪

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:32.780
♪ This feeling-- ♪

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.580
♪ Is it love? ♪

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.080
♪ This feeling ♪

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:41.420
♪ Must be love ♪

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:45.790
♪ I want to go on just like this ♪

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:50.840
♪ To a place (to a place)
that I've seen (that I've seen) ♪

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:56.760
♪ In my dreams ♪

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:07.570
♪ No names, no destinies,
no yesterdays, no tomorrows ♪

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:16.120
♪ A pristine star shoots by;
white flowers shower down ♪

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:21.210
♪ To a place (to a place)
that I've seen (that I've seen) ♪

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:28.460
♪ In my dreams ♪

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.100
Wow! They're gorgeous!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.400
Let's hit the balcony!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.490
Rem...

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.130
Um...

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:53.090
That song is still running through my head.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.260
I guess I really do...

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:19.320
Vampires!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.410
Where's the sacred tome?

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.740
We know you know!

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.710
Azuna! Get Ritsuka!

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:27.710
On it!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:34.000
By the sacred Name, obey me!
O ye who lurk in darkness,

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.960
begone from here forevermore!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.600
By the sacred Name, obey me!

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:45.100
O ye who lurk in darkness,
begone from here forevermore!

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:52.770
Ritsuka, we'll keep you safe.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.110
Azuna...

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:59.570
Become thou dust in the sacred Light and vanish!

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.570
Lindo...

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:04.330
O ye who lurk in darkness, begone!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.580
Begone!

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:30.600
Lindo!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.200
Ritsuka!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.210
I'll be taking her.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.210
Ritsuka!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.840
Let go of her!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.090
Ritsuka!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.600
You little brat!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:34.170
No!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.280
Ritsuka...

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:16.290
Azuna? Azuna!

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:29.970
Azuna! Azuna! Azuna! Azuna!

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:45.990
We've found it at last, Lord Nesta!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:49.780
Just you wait. I'll be back to collect it--

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.740
just as soon as that light fades!

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:59.710
<i>It's a secret you can't tell anyone</i>

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:10.300
<i>Wonth gir sliv edhti wecnad</i>

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.760
<i>Wonth gir</i>

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:17.390
<i>Cracking a smile only at the witching hour</i>

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:20.310
<i>Spreading rumors sotto voce</i>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.860
<i>You knocked on the door</i>

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:26.400
<i>Without looking behind you</i>

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:30.070
<i>With all these mysteries, impossible to solve</i>

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>You stopped cold, weak in the knees</i>

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:35.540
<i>It hacks everything</i>

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:37.790
<i>The curse of love</i>

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>The curse--and you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:44.460
<i>If you're confused about the touch on your skin</i>

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:48.090
<i>We just can't be transparent</i>

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:51.850
<i>Soon (soon)</i>

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:54.560
<i>Won't you take this hand?</i>

00:22:54.560 --> 00:23:02.360
<i>Mademoiselle, mademoiselle:
I'll make you happy</i>

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:06.150
<i>This night will never come again</i>

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:09.030
<i>So let us swear to one another</i>

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>The black clown singing of love
at the tip of the moon</i>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:18.160
<i>Obscuring the sky</i>

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:23.090
<i>Casting a spell with a bewitching fever</i>

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:30.590
Give it up. You can't protect her.

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:33.550
I would die for her!

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:35.890
As you wish.

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:41.060
"War Cry of Secrets and Contrariness"

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:40.850
Act 9: War Cry of Secrets and Contrariness.
